 ### Official Metrics Evaluation
-Official Metrics Evaluation loads render and ground truth images as tensors, handling batched or unbatched formats based on the style. It selects metric functions based on style: `standard_3dgs` uses `loss_utils.ssim` and `batched=True`; `beta_splatting` uses `fused_ssim` and `batched=False`. It computes LPIPS using `lpips_module.lpips(render, gt, net_type="vgg").mean()`, checks that all metric values are finite, and computes mean metrics across all views, saving them to `results.json` and `per_view.json` [S3, unofficial].
